<topic id="git-addon-ignore-a-file">
    <title>Ignore a file</title>
    <body>
        
            <p>To add an untracked file to a project's <codeph>.gitignore</codeph>, on <uicontrol
          conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs0-git-staging-view"/>, follow
        these steps: </p>
        
        <ol>
            <li>
        On <uicontrol
            conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs1-unstaged-files"/>,
          right-click a file and the contextual menu opens.
      </li>
      <li>
        From the contextual menu, select <uicontrol
            conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/>
          <b>></b>
          <uicontrol conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore-file"/>.
      </li>
        </ol>
      <p>
      <fig id="fig_qtj_myd_mjc">
        <title>Ignore a file</title>
        <image href="../img/git-addon/staging/ignore/ignore_file.png" id="image_oxz_pyd_mjc"/>
      </fig>
    </p><p>The untracked file is added to the end of the project <codeph>.gitignore</codeph> and will no
        longer appear on <uicontrol
          conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs1-unstaged-files"/>.</p>
      <p>To re-enable change tracking of the file,
        <?oxy_comment_start author="adrian_lapadat" timestamp="20260527T114039+0300" comment="add ref to section explaining this"?>remove
        it<?oxy_comment_end?> from the project <codeph>gitignore</codeph>.</p>
    </body>
</topic>
